### Component 8: Angular Timeline UI (`web/`)

#### [NEW] `web/` (Angular app via `@angular/cli`)
- Minimal Angular 18+ app with a single-page timeline view.
- **`environment.ts`**: `apiBaseUrl` injected from build-time env var `API_BASE_URL`, defaults to `http://localhost:8000` for local dev.
