|------|-------|-----------|
| **P1** | Data layer (`data/`) + real read tools + `StaticRetriever` | `test_real_tools.py` passes |
| **P2** | `core/untrusted.py` + injection fixtures | `test_injection.py` passes |
| **P3** | `core/approval.py` + approval endpoints + graph wiring | `test_approval.py` passes |
| **P4** | SSE streaming in `POST /plan` + `core/planner/events.py` | `test_sse.py` passes |
| **P5** | Angular timeline UI under `web/` | Manual verification: SSE events visible in browser |

After all passes: populate `docs/FAILURE-MODES.md` with 15 scenarios.

